SUMMARY:Mini vMac v2.6
DESCRIPTION:Mini vMac 2.6 | minivmac4ios-2.6\n\n* Added 512×384 variant of
  Mac II\n* Requires iOS 13.4\n    * Dropping 32-bit support (iOS 9) made t
 he app smaller\n* Prefer pixel-perfect scaling when display scaling filter
  is set to nearest\n* Auto-hide iOS home indicator\n* Partially fix some c
 ommand-key shortcuts going to iOS instead of the emulated Mac (#45)\n    *
  ⌘-w and most others will get passed to the emulated machine if it's run
 ning\n    * ⌘-q and ⌘-h don't seem interceptable\, the app doesn't rec
 eive any key events for them\, but ⌘-q doesn't do anything (or maybe it 
 does in some other configuration?)\, and ⌘-h will take you to the home s
 creen\n* visionOS support (only tested in simulator)\n\n**Full Changelog**
 : https://github.com/zydeco/minivmac4ios/compare/v2.5...v2.6
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/minivmac.json
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
